Functionally, it works perfectly. Except for some reason all the windows seem to be getting drawn slightly left of where they are supposed to, so nothing is quite aligned properly. On top of that, the pictures being drawn within the windows seem to be either not scaling properly, or drawing slightly to the right of where they are supposed to, as the right edges of them seem to be getting cut off (This picture issue, suprisingly, is not happening with the "ChoiceWindow". Only the window align issue is affecting the "ChoiceWindow")
